## Run / Test / Build

```bash
# Maven
mvn spring-boot:run                 # Run locally
mvn test                            # Run all tests
mvn -Dtest=ClassName#method test    # Run a single test
mvn package                         # Build jar
mvn package -DskipTests             # Build skipping tests
mvn dependency:resolve              # Resolve deps after `git worktree add`
mvn dependency:tree                 # Dependency tree

# Gradle (use ./gradlew instead of bare `gradle` to pin wrapper version)
./gradlew bootRun                   # Run locally
./gradlew test                      # Run all tests
./gradlew test --tests ClassName.method    # Run a single test
./gradlew bootJar                   # Build jar
./gradlew bootJar -x test           # Build skipping tests
./gradlew dependencies              # Dependency tree

# Build verification after worktree add (compile-only, fast)
mvn compile                         # or: ./gradlew compileJava
```

